1
00:00:00,238 --> 00:00:02,148
(Raj:)Now she knows I'm a desperate mess

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,980
instead of just being pretty sure!

3
00:00:06,478 --> 00:00:08,078
(Raj:)It's Lucy.

4
00:00:08,246 --> 00:00:09,816
(Raj:)She wants to meet for coffee.

5
00:00:09,981 --> 00:00:12,151
I love you, Penny!

6
00:00:17,088 --> 00:00:19,498
Hey, what are you working on?

7
00:00:20,258 --> 00:00:22,868
(Sheldon:)I'm thinking about
how one could use the fact

8
00:00:23,027 --> 00:00:27,037
(Sheldon:)that a rapidly rotating mirror
turns virtual photons into real ones

9
00:00:27,198 --> 00:00:29,768
(Sheldon:)as a method of observing dark energy.

10
00:00:29,934 --> 00:00:31,504
(Howard:)That's a pretty cool idea.

11
00:00:31,669 --> 00:00:33,479
(Sheldon:)Yeah. It's great you're here.

12
00:00:33,638 --> 00:00:35,208
(Sheldon:)I'd love to get
an engineer's opinion.

13
00:00:35,373 --> 00:00:36,443
(Leonard:)Sure.

14
00:00:36,608 --> 00:00:38,778
(Sheldon:)This chair is squeaky.

15
00:00:42,714 --> 00:00:44,714
(Sheldon:)Now, do I fix it or get a new one?

16
00:00:46,351 --> 00:00:48,801
(Leonard:)Well, Sheldon,
it took me all morning,

17
00:00:48,953 --> 00:00:51,233
(Leonard:)but I found the owner
of the video store.

18
00:00:51,389 --> 00:00:54,059
(Leonard:)And I am happy to report
that he died peacefully in his sleep,

19
00:00:54,225 --> 00:00:55,895
(Leonard:)drunk at the bottom of a pool.

20
00:00:57,495 --> 00:01:00,405
(Leonard:)Anyway, there is no one
to return the DVD to,

